WEBVTT

00:03:28.485 --> 00:03:31.555
150 mil per jam melalui dataran garam Bonneville

00:03:31.555 --> 00:03:36.026
mengelilingi Thunderhill Raceway Park di tengah terik matahari,

00:03:36.026 --> 00:03:38.665
angin, dan hujan,

00:03:38.665 --> 00:03:43.683
dan melalui 153 tikungan dan 12,4 mil

00:03:43.683 --> 00:03:45.245
pada jalur Pikes Peak Hill Climb

00:03:45.245 --> 00:03:48.718
di Colorado tanpa pengemudi.

00:03:48.718 --> 00:03:50.166
(Tawa)

00:03:50.166 --> 00:03:55.732
(Tepuk tangan)

00:03:55.732 --> 00:03:59.011
Saya rasa tidak perlu dikatakan lagi kami banyak bersenang-senang

00:03:59.011 --> 00:04:00.315
dalam melakukannya.